    "body": "Critical insertion witnesses can use different roots, and the existing reversal criterion does not cover donor piles of two. S011 adds exact terminal-vector forest certificates, three-output root transport/used-edge exposure, one- and two-token terminal exchanges, and exact CLEAR/TWO root typing. It also derives a separate restriction on already-stackable critical CLEAR losers: when clear >= stack+2, heavy vertices lie on no triangle.\n\nUniversal critical ASH* remains OPEN separately for STACK and CLEAR. Bipartite critical insertions cannot share a CLEAR root; actual C5 examples show that an odd-cycle-supported three-output certificate can still fail clearing. An assigned abstract root family demonstrates that root typing/self-root tests alone do not establish a common STACK root; it is expressly not a graph/configuration counterexample. Full proofs, dependencies, adversarial verdicts, remaining universal obligations and a complete FUTURE/UNEXECUTED S012 prompt are included. Known grammar/ancestry/signed3/+3/triangle mechanisms and earlier TreeStack work remain credited. No delegation or deferred final-stage action occurred.\n\nValidation: all25 inherited check-only commands and six new producer/checkers pass; immutable manifests and governance validation pass. Three individually prior-hashed campaigns independently validate 90 complete layers/97,839 configurations, 116,401 exact terminal transport certificates/507,217 literal moves, and 97,798 root normalization inputs/120 critical insertion families. Negative closures, exceptional terminal pairs, exact scopes and resource logs are retained. Historical evidence bytes/cutoffs are unchanged. These results do not provide independent human/kernel certification or advance the universal gate.\n\nIntegration pin (actual post-commit metadata):\n- Entry main and sole authored parent: `6f0d63b023daa5b3424b2ef166e25786f477332a`.\n- Single authored S011 head: `42961f1099f9389c32c26ea6a2d1fdacce3646b0`.\n- Authored tree: `a9cb765956c74eac52e03666ccb43a7684222f0d`.\n- Actual hosted jobs/checks and outgoing non-force two-parent merge/main reread will be recorded here after verification. No auto-merge or force.\n\nHead verification: actual run [38697669419](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38697669419) completed successfully. All five actual jobs and check-runs completed successfully.\n\n| Job/check-run ID | Name | Status | Conclusion |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 116297983441 | validate | completed | success |\n| 116297983580 | s005-replay (0) | completed | success |\n| 116297983646 | s005-replay (1) | completed | success |\n| 116297983692 | s005-replay (2) | completed | success |\n| 116297983863 | s005-replay (3) | completed | success |\n\nCombined commit status is pending with zero contexts and an empty status list; no actual job remains pending. Branch protection404 and empty effective rules/rulesets were reconciled without policy changes. Immediately before integration, remote main still equals the sole authored parent.\n\nBoundary precision: the mass>=2 hypothesis in58 applies throughout its insertion clause d=c+e_w; all critical insertions satisfy it. The singleton produced from c=0 is outside that scope and has no TWO root.\n\nActual non-force two-parent integration:\n- Merge/main `ca4aad7abf25d396eed16c6e3d89179ea6215b60`.\n- Merge tree `a9cb765956c74eac52e03666ccb43a7684222f0d`, identical to the authored session tree.\n- Ordered parents `6f0d63b023daa5b3424b2ef166e25786f477332a`, then `42961f1099f9389c32c26ea6a2d1fdacce3646b0`.\n- GitHub PR/ref/commit and independent git ls-remote main reread agree. Post-merge hosted verification is recorded below. S012 and all final-stage actions remain unexecuted.\n\nMain push verification: actual run [38698230836](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38698230836) completed successfully. All five actual main jobs and check-runs completed successfully.\n\n| Main job/check-run ID | Name | Status | Conclusion |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 116299800391 | validate | completed | success |\n| 116299800649 | s005-replay (1) | completed | success |\n| 116299800792 | s005-replay (2) | completed | success |\n| 116299800840 | s005-replay (3) | completed | success |\n| 116299800920 | s005-replay (0) | completed | success |\n\nMain combined status is pending with zero contexts and an empty status list; every actual job/check-run is successful. Final independent GitHub ref/commit and git ls-remote rereads, local HEAD/main and origin/main agree at `ca4aad7abf25d396eed16c6e3d89179ea6215b60`; working tree is clean. One authored S011 commit, ordinary PR and non-force two-parent merge verified. S011 session closeout is complete; universal critical ASH* remains OPEN separately for STACK and CLEAR, Phase1 IN_PROGRESS. S012 and all deferred final activities remain unexecuted.\n",
